                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}A_{\\text{triangle}}&=\\frac12\\times40\\times60=1200\\text{ m}\\\\A_{\\text{rectangle}}&=(60-40)\\times60=1200\\text{ m}\\\\d&=1200+1200=2400\\text{ m}\\end{aligned}",
